      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced shallots and cook until they are slightly softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the bacon slices to the skillet and cook until crispy, about 4-5 minutes.",
    "Remove the cooked bacon from the skillet with a slotted spoon and set aside.",
    "In the same skillet, add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Return the cooked bacon to the skillet and stir in salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the cooked shallots and bacon hot, garnished with chopped parsley."
